1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Step thirteen. The agent deletes your
tests.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Step fourteen. It overwrites the config.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,500
rewindagent replay lists every step.
Twelve was the last good one.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,000
So rewind to twelve.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,500
Four files back. The tests, and the
config.

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,500
And the rewind itself can be undone.

7
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,500
Install it from the repository, then run
rewindagent install in your project.

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,000
Your editor has had undo for decades. Now
your agent does.
